art.mem-sentinel launchd agent, 5-min interval) now logs ORPHAN lines for PPID-1 copilot/uv/serena processes and reaps copilot orphans >24h and uv/serena orphans >1h (REAPED lines).\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n1. On or after 2026-09-13, review ~/Library/Logs/mem-sentinel.log (and .log.1 rotation) covering at least 7 days of normal multi-agent use.\n2. No python/serena process >1GB RSS blocked >24h appears in the top5 snapshots.\n3. Any ORPHAN/REAPED lines are reviewed: REAPED events confirm the reaper works as designed; recurring ORPHAN churn (new orphans appearing daily) is evidence of an upstream harness bug and warrants a new bug ticket with the log excerpt.\n4. Findings recorded as a comment here; if clean, close.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"bdd0-14ef-2973-4902","ticket_type":"task","title":"Soak-validate Serena mirror + orphan-reaper fix: one week of clean mem-sentinel logs","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f6a277a3-b45e-43f5-b3a2-e9015be3dd22","04327fd1-6f5b-4035-895a-da7c02dcdd51"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788741138556420978,"uuid":"402db894-9575-4bc0-8103-597818e41c51"}